# Written by @nuxt/test-utils, which stamps its own version into it and
# rewrites it whenever the installed copy disagrees with the stamp. It carries
# nothing package-lock.json does not already pin, so tracking it only produced
# a file that flips back and forth between checkouts with different installs.
